---
args: { request: CustomerLaunchRequest, records: Onboarding[] }
returns: GoalContract
---
1. Match the requested case to exactly one onboarding record. Keep its customer identity, contractual scope baseline, approved exclusions, and target date separate.
2. Translate only request.scope into review objectives. Aspirations from executive notes are not commitments without customer authority and observable acceptance evidence.
3. Require expected version, named outcome owner, testable completion condition, and customer scope authority for each proposed commitment; preserve missing items as blockers.
